{
  "title": "Hearty Tunisian Lamb Tagine",
  "description": "A sweet and savory Tunisian dish featuring lamb loin chops cooked in a stone bowl, perfect for a Mediterranean-inspired meal. This recipe is great for meal prep and can be served with a variety of sides.",
  "cuisine": "Tunisian",
